WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.793 --> 00:00:02.393
JEFFERY WRIGHT
Reality is not a straight line.

00:00:03.153 --> 00:00:07.569
Every passing moment is a chance
for a new offshoot. A new variation.

00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:11.727
In fact, there are more realities
than you can possibly fathom.

00:00:12.153 --> 00:00:14.577
An infinite number of ‘What Ifs’.

00:00:15.984 --> 00:00:19.489
I’m Jeffrey Wright, and as the voice of
The Watcher in Marvel’s What If,

00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:21.406
I can see what few others can:

00:00:22.089 --> 00:00:25.802
the totality of the multiverse
across all time and space.

00:00:26.104 --> 00:00:30.197
The stories you thought you knew
are nothing like you remember.

00:00:30.617 --> 00:00:31.957
Familiar faces...

00:00:32.771 --> 00:00:33.684
KORATH
Who are you?

00:00:33.749 --> 00:00:35.449
JEFFERY WRIGHT
…in unfamiliar roles.

00:00:35.915 --> 00:00:36.762
KORATH
Star-Lord!

00:00:36.842 --> 00:00:37.715
JEFFERY WRIGHT
A captain…

00:00:37.742 --> 00:00:38.955
COLONEL FLYNN 
Women aren’t soldiers.

00:00:39.075 --> 00:00:39.862
CARTER
Howard, get ready!

00:00:39.975 --> 00:00:40.969
HOWARD
Agent Carter!

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:42.607
JEFFERY WRIGHT
…No one expected.

00:00:45.534 --> 00:00:48.215
And foes… who became friends.

00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:53.833
JEFFERY WRIGHT
Wow, I did not see that coming.

